@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Account/Pages/InvalidPasswordReset.razor     URL: /Account/InvalidPasswordReset
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Identity template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: Shown when a password-reset link is missing its code (e.g. a truncated link).
   ================================================================================================= *@
@page "/Account/InvalidPasswordReset"

<PageTitle>Invalid password reset</PageTitle>

<h1>Invalid password reset</h1>
<p role="alert">
    The password reset link is invalid.
</p>
